@SqliteGate_HostAddress = http://localhost:5185

### Reset the sample data
DELETE {{SqliteGate_HostAddress}}/api/gate/data

### What is the gate doing right now?
GET {{SqliteGate_HostAddress}}/api/gate

### ---------- Writes: the same insert, one per package ----------

### Insert through raw ADO.NET
POST {{SqliteGate_HostAddress}}/api/todos/ado
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy milk (ado)"
}

### Insert through Dapper
POST {{SqliteGate_HostAddress}}/api/todos/dapper
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy milk (dapper)"
}

### Insert through EF Core
POST {{SqliteGate_HostAddress}}/api/todos/efcore
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Buy milk (efcore)"
}

### ---------- Reads: never queued behind a writer ----------

### List the most recent todos
GET {{SqliteGate_HostAddress}}/api/todos?take=20

### Totals, broken down by which package wrote each row
GET {{SqliteGate_HostAddress}}/api/todos/count

### ---------- The lost-update test ----------

### Increment the counter (reads, then writes back one more)
POST {{SqliteGate_HostAddress}}/api/counter/increment

### Read the counter — after N concurrent increments this must be exactly N
GET {{SqliteGate_HostAddress}}/api/counter
